      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-22T19:38:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I checked with the Dawn team, that Dawn safely handles the secondary transition internally, but with a slight performance cost.\n\nTo avoid this, we can pass the intended layout from the Kotlin API. Given the size of this CL/topic, are you okay with me tracking this API update in a follow-up bug? (As this is not a breaking change and EAP partners are already using it)",
      "parentUuid": "4124296e_2557c762",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 435,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 438,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "9c46cad9dbd826f739d0e9047d5133234c2adf46",
